  "description": "Confluence CUES 11 is a light ebike made to get you out on more gravel adventures.\n\nIts MAHLE X30 hub-drive motor is all but hidden until you push the pedals. But once you tap into its 45Nm max torque and up to 45 miles of range, new paths and route ideas open up everywhere you look. Suspension fork and dropper post compatibility, plus 700c x 50mm tire clearance let your imagination wander even farther.\n\nConfluence’s geometry makes for a stable, reassuring ride as you hit unknown roads at higher speeds. For those far-out rides, load up the Three-Pack mounts and rack mounts with layers, tools, snacks — maybe even your kit for an afternoon coffee or tea. Get wild.\n\nThe dependable Shimano CUES 1 x 11 drivetrain keeps you rolling at the right cadence, and the CUES hydraulic brakes can pull you confidently to a stop even from top speed. Add Confluence to your adventures and see how it changes your range.\n\nMeets UL 2849, and UL 2271 certification",
